+**Worktree.** Work from a git worktree off main. A subagent works in the worktree its brief names, or in its own with `isolation: "worktree"`. Multiple `Task` calls on the same branch each get their own worktree, or `git fetch && git reset --hard origin/<branch>` between them. Dirty branch with unrelated work: patch out, fresh worktree, apply. Snarled worktree: reset from main, redo minimally.
 
